"%@ is not an executable file." = "%@ 不是可执行文件。";
"Approximate Preview" = "近似预览";
"Ask Before Rendering" = "渲染前每次询问";
"Automatic" = "自动";
"Check Again" = "重新检测";
"Code was not run and the project configuration was not applied" = "未执行代码、未应用项目配置";
"Could not start Quarto (%@)." = "无法启动 Quarto（%@）。";
"In a standard install folder" = "来自常见安装目录";
"Looking for Quarto…" = "正在查找 Quarto…";
"Not set" = "未设置";
"On the login shell’s PATH" = "来自登录 shell 的 PATH";
"Once per opened document, before Quarto first runs its code." = "每个打开的文档在 Quarto 首次执行其代码前询问一次。";
"Opens .qmd documents and previews callouts, cross-references, code cells and includes approximately; code is never run." = "打开 .qmd 文档，近似预览 callout、交叉引用、代码单元和 include；不执行代码。";
"Quarto %@ at %@ is too old: real rendering needs 1.4 or later." = "%2$@ 处的 Quarto %1$@ 版本过旧：真渲染需要 1.4 或更高版本。";
"Quarto Path" = "Quarto 路径";
"Quarto Real Render" = "Quarto 真渲染";
"Quarto could not render the document; see the log." = "Quarto 渲染失败，详见日志。";
"Quarto did not start a preview within 30 seconds." = "Quarto 未能在 30 秒内启动预览。";
"Quarto exited (code %lld)" = "Quarto 已退出（code %lld）";
"Quarto has not written anything yet." = "Quarto 尚未输出任何内容。";
"Quarto on this Mac will run the code cells in this document, including ```{python} blocks and inline `{python} expr` and `r expr` code. Only do this for documents you trust." = "将用本机 Quarto 执行本文档中的代码单元——包括 ```{python} 代码块和 `{python} expr`、`r expr` 行内代码。只对你信任的文档这样做。";
"Quarto was not found. Install Quarto 1.4 or later from quarto.org, or set its path in Settings ▸ Extensions ▸ Quarto." = "未找到 Quarto。请从 quarto.org 安装 Quarto 1.4 或更高版本，或在 设置 ▸ 扩展 ▸ Quarto 中指定其路径。";
"Quarto · Approximate Preview" = "Quarto · 近似预览";
"Quarto" = "Quarto";
"Read from your login shell; set them in your shell configuration." = "取自登录 shell；请在 shell 配置中设置。";
"Render with Quarto" = "用 Quarto 渲染";
"Render" = "渲染";
"Renders the document with the Quarto installed on this Mac when you switch the preview to Quarto (⌘⌥R). The document’s code runs then, and only then." = "把预览切到 Quarto（⌘⌥R）时，用本机安装的 Quarto 渲染文档。只有这时才会执行文档中的代码。";
"Run this document’s code with Quarto?" = "用 Quarto 执行本文档的代码？";
"Set manually" = "手动指定";
"Supports callouts, divs, spans, citations and cross-references, figure and table captions, grid tables, equations, inert shortcode markers, ```{python}``` / ```{r}``` code cells (highlighted only, never run) and {{< include >}} (limited to the document’s folder, at most 5 levels deep)." = "支持 callout、div、span、引用与交叉引用、图表标题、网格表格、公式、shortcode 惰性标记，以及 ```{python}``` / ```{r}``` 代码单元（只高亮，不执行）和 {{< include >}}（限文档所在目录，最多 5 层）。";
"Turn on the Quarto extension to preview callouts and cross-references" = "启用 Quarto 扩展以获得 callout / 交叉引用预览";
"_quarto.yml, _extensions and .bib files are not read, and cross-reference numbers show as “?”." = "不读取 _quarto.yml、_extensions 或 .bib，交叉引用编号显示为“?”。";
"“%@ --version” failed (%@)." = "“%1$@ --version” 运行失败（%2$@）。";
"“%@” is part of the Quarto project in %@. Quarto on this Mac will render the whole project: the code cells of every document in it, and the project’s filters and scripts, may run. Only do this for projects you trust." = "“%1$@”属于 %2$@ 中的 Quarto 项目。本机 Quarto 将渲染整个项目：项目中每个文档的代码单元，以及项目的过滤器和脚本，都可能被执行。只对你信任的项目这样做。";
